onical-first). All six ruled pins are on real code (objectql restart harness, real SQLite index pins, repository pins, showcase dogfood); ablation confirms the restart pin discriminates. Residuals (registry heal sweeps the bundle's hydrated overlay group on a by-name reset; package-batch doors and cluster fan-out address the canonical member; os migrate duplicates reports the overlay probes unreadable on a store this version has not booted) are stated in the PR and changeset.",
